{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Dystopia Derby</i></strong> is a grappling hook racing game where you can swap between different abilities mid race to go faster. The speed cap is your skill cap. It includes features such as high speed platform racing similar to <i>Sonic</i>, gun swapping (vehicle swapping) similar to boomer shooters like <i>DOOM </i>and <i>Ultrakill</i>, and anime flair similar to <i>Dragon Ball Z</i> and <i>Attack on Titan</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937820/extras/b8e196a999bc692e8a51972064eeb33c.poster.avif?t=1755893298\" aria-label=\"Entering a wormhole at mach 3\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937820/extras/b8e196a999bc692e8a51972064eeb33c.webm?t=1755893298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937820/extras/b8e196a999bc692e8a51972064eeb33c.mp4?t=1755893298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your vehicle loadout to build your own movement system and play your own way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synergize your build with various game-changing items to reach better times</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock more vehicles to expand your arsenal of movement abilities</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3937820?t=1755893298","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937820/e160bfa42aeecd799b97393f03f0cfc4627f997b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755893298","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937820/6bc9cdc8d3181fd1da3ca5ad6893da27f52f7d95/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1